WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:58.892 --> 00:01:00.268
Don't be afraid.

00:01:19.996 --> 00:01:20.830
I saw you.

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:25.919
In the garden. It was you, wasn't it?

00:01:32.634 --> 00:01:35.136
My mother told me about you.

00:01:36.304 --> 00:01:40.016
She saw little people here
when she was young.

00:01:42.102 --> 00:01:44.479
Was it you that she saw?

00:01:47.357 --> 00:01:48.274
Was it?

